 Allah purifies whom He wills, and Allah is Hearing and Knowing"}},{"ar":"زَكِيّ","kind":"adjective","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"pure","word":null,"ex":{"s":19,"a":19,"p":9,"ar":["قَالَ","إِنَّمَآ","أَنَا۠","رَسُولُ","رَبِّكِ","لِأَهَبَ","لَكِ","غُلَـٰمًا","زَكِيًّا"],"en":"He said, \"I am only the messenger of your Lord to give you [news of] a pure boy"}},{"ar":"زَكِيَّة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"pure, innocent","word":null,"ex":{"s":18,"a":74,"p":10,"ar":["فَٱنطَلَقَا","حَتَّىٰٓ","إِذَا","لَقِيَا","غُلَـٰمًا","فَقَتَلَهُۥ","قَالَ","أَقَتَلْتَ","نَفْسًا","زَكِيَّةًۢ","بِغَيْرِ","نَفْسٍ","لَّقَدْ","جِئْتَ","شَيْـًٔا","نُّكْرًا"],"en":"So they set out, until when they met a boy, al-Khidh r killed him. [Moses] said, \"Have you killed a pure soul for other than [having killed] a soul? You have certainly done a deplorable thing"}}],"surahs":[[2,9],[24,6],[9,5],[4,4],[19,4],[18,3],[3,2],[5,2],[22,2],[35,2],[80,2],[7,1],[20,1],[21,1],[23,1],[27,1],[30,1],[31,1],[33,1],[41,1],[53,1],[58,1],[62,1],[73,1],[79,1],[87,1],[91,1],[92,1],[98,1]]}